### ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### SULO API Tests — Supabase REST API
### Use with REST Client extension (humao.rest-client)
### ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### ─── Configuration ───
@supabaseUrl = https://your-project.supabase.co
@supabaseAnonKey = your-anon-key-here
@contentType = application/json
@authorization = Bearer {{supabaseAnonKey}}

### ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 1. UNITS ENDPOINTS
### ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Get all units
GET {{supabaseUrl}}/rest/v1/units?select=* HTTP/1.1
apikey: {{supabaseAnonKey}}
Authorization: {{authorization}}

### Get active units only
GET {{supabaseUrl}}/rest/v1/units?is_active=eq.true&select=* HTTP/1.1
apikey: {{supabaseAnonKey}}
Authorization: {{authorization}}

### Get single unit by ID
GET {{supabaseUrl}}/rest/v1/units?unit_id=eq.YOUR-UNIT-ID&select=* HTTP/1.1
apikey: {{supabaseAnonKey}}
Authorization: {{authorization}}

### Create new unit
POST {{supabaseUrl}}/rest/v1/units HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
apikey: {{supabaseAnonKey}}
Authorization: {{authorization}}

{
    "name": "Karenderya Unit C",
    "location": "New Kitchen, Brgy. Hilera",
    "description": "Third digester unit for testing"
}

### ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 2. SENSOR READINGS ENDPOINTS
### ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Get latest reading for a unit
GET {{supabaseUrl}}/rest/v1/sensor_readings?unit_id=eq.YOUR-UNIT-ID&order=recorded_at.desc&limit=1 HTTP/1.1
apikey: {{supabaseAnonKey}}
Authorization: {{authorization}}

### Get last 10 readings for a unit
GET {{supabaseUrl}}/rest/v1/sensor_readings?unit_id=eq.YOUR-UNIT-ID&order=recorded_at.desc&limit=10 HTTP/1.1
apikey: {{supabaseAnonKey}}
Authorization: {{authorization}}

### Get readings from last 24 hours
GET {{supabaseUrl}}/rest/v1/sensor_readings?unit_id=eq.YOUR-UNIT-ID&recorded_at=gte.{{now-24h}}&order=recorded_at.desc HTTP/1.1
apikey: {{supabaseAnonKey}}
Authorization: {{authorization}}

### Get readings by status (critical only)
GET {{supabaseUrl}}/rest/v1/sensor_readings?unit_id=eq.YOUR-UNIT-ID&status=eq.2&order=recorded_at.desc HTTP/1.1
apikey: {{supabaseAnonKey}}
Authorization: {{authorization}}

### Create new sensor reading (ESP32 endpoint)
POST {{supabaseUrl}}/rest/v1/sensor_readings HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
apikey: {{supabaseAnonKey}}
Authorization: {{authorization}}

{
    "unit_id": "YOUR-UNIT-ID",
    "temperature": 35.5,
    "ph": 7.2,
    "gas_level": 2500.00,
    "pressure": 105.50,
    "flow_rate": 2.5000,
    "status": 0,
    "valve_open": false
}

### ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 3. ALERTS ENDPOINTS
### ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Get all unacknowledged alerts
GET {{supabaseUrl}}/rest/v1/alerts?acknowledged=eq.false&order=created_at.desc HTTP/1.1
apikey: {{supabaseAnonKey}}
Authorization: {{authorization}}

### Get critical alerts
GET {{supabaseUrl}}/rest/v1/alerts?severity=eq.critical&acknowledged=eq.false&order=created_at.desc HTTP/1.1
apikey: {{supabaseAnonKey}}
Authorization: {{authorization}}

### Get alerts for specific unit
GET {{supabaseUrl}}/rest/v1/alerts?unit_id=eq.YOUR-UNIT-ID&order=created_at.desc&limit=20 HTTP/1.1
apikey: {{supabaseAnonKey}}
Authorization: {{authorization}}

### Create new alert (ESP32 endpoint)
POST {{supabaseUrl}}/rest/v1/alerts HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
apikey: {{supabaseAnonKey}}
Authorization: {{authorization}}

{
    "unit_id": "YOUR-UNIT-ID",
    "reading_id": 123,
    "alert_type": "overpressure",
    "severity": "critical",
    "message": "Pressure at 210 kPa exceeds 200 kPa limit"
}

### Acknowledge an alert
PATCH {{supabaseUrl}}/rest/v1/alerts?alert_id=eq.ALERT-ID HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
apikey: {{supabaseAnonKey}}
Authorization: {{authorization}}

{
    "acknowledged": true,
    "acknowledged_at": "2026-09-09T12:00:00Z"
}

### ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 4. DIGESTER STATUS ENDPOINTS
### ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Get current status for all units
GET {{supabaseUrl}}/rest/v1/digester_status?select=*,units(name) HTTP/1.1
apikey: {{supabaseAnonKey}}
Authorization: {{authorization}}

### Get status for specific unit
GET {{supabaseUrl}}/rest/v1/digester_status?unit_id=eq.YOUR-UNIT-ID&select=* HTTP/1.1
apikey: {{supabaseAnonKey}}
Authorization: {{authorization}}

### ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 5. AUTHENTICATION ENDPOINTS
### ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Sign in with email/password
POST {{supabaseUrl}}/auth/v1/token?grant_type=password HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
apikey: {{supabaseAnonKey}}

{
    "email": "admin@sulo.local",
    "password": "your-password"
}

### Get current user
GET {{supabaseUrl}}/auth/v1/user HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR-JWT-TOKEN
apikey: {{supabaseAnonKey}}

### Sign out
POST {{supabaseUrl}}/auth/v1/logout HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR-JWT-TOKEN
apikey: {{supabaseAnonKey}}

### ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 6. REALTIME SUBSCRIPTION TEST
### ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Subscribe to sensor_readings changes (WebSocket)
### Note: This is a WebSocket connection, use a WebSocket client
### URL: wss://your-project.supabase.co/realtime/v1/websocket
### Auth: Bearer {{supabaseAnonKey}}
### Channels: [{"topic":"sensor_readings","event":"*","schema":"public","table":"sensor_readings"}]

### ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 7. HELPER QUERIES
### ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Get average readings per unit (last 24h)
GET {{supabaseUrl}}/rest/v1/rpc/get_average_readings HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
apikey: {{supabaseAnonKey}}
Authorization: {{authorization}}

### Get unit statistics
GET {{supabaseUrl}}/rest/v1/rpc/get_unit_stats HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
apikey: {{supabaseAnonKey}}
Authorization: {{authorization}}

### ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### NOTES:
### ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 
### 1. Replace YOUR-UNIT-ID with actual UUID from units table
### 2. Replace ALERT-ID with actual alert_id
### 3. Replace supabaseAnonKey with your actual anon key
### 4. All requests require 'apikey' header
### 5. Authenticated requests require 'Authorization: Bearer <token>'
### 6. Use ?select=* to get all columns
### 7. Use ?select=column1,column2 to get specific columns
### 8. Use ?order=column.desc for descending order
### 9. Use ?limit=N to limit results
### 10. Use ?column=eq.value for exact match
### 
### ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
